            <h2 class="fur-title--heading-2 fur-text-purple fur-max-w-[900px] ">
            Data Tools &amp; Resources        </h2>
    
            <p class="fur-body--lg fur-text-black fur-max-w-[900px] ">
            Explore the data tools and resources we built to identify key housing and economic indicators.        </p>
    
    
    </header>


        <div class="swiper js-slider ">
            <div class="swiper-wrapper lg:fur-grid-cols-3  lg:fur-grid lg:fur-gap-6">
