<article class="fur-bg-white fur-p-6 fur-border fur-border-orange fur-flex fur-flex-col fur-gap-8 fur-rounded-radius-1 fur-h-full">
    
    <h3 class="fur-text-purple fur-title--heading-5">
        CoreData.nyc    </h3>

            <p class="fur-body--sm">
            Explore CoreData.nyc’s Subsidized Housing Database, the only property-level database of New York City’s subsidized housing.        </p>
    
    
<div class="fur-flex fur-flex-wrap fur-items-center fur-gap-8 !fur-gap-3 fur-mt-auto fur-flex-col !fur-items-start">
    
<a href="https://coredata.nyc/"
    class="link-orange"
     target=""     rel="noopener noreferrer">
  Go to Tool</a>
</div>
</article>
                    </div>
                                    <div class="swiper-slide fur-h-auto">
                        
<article class="fur-bg-white fur-p-6 fur-border fur-border-orange fur-flex fur-flex-col fur-gap-8 fur-rounded-radius-1 fur-h-full">
    
    <h3 class="fur-text-purple fur-title--heading-5">
        State of the City    </h3>

            <p class="fur-body--sm">
            Citywide annual data that shows housing production trends, information on rents, demographics and incomes, and residential property values.        </p>
    
    
<div class="fur-flex fur-flex-wrap fur-items-center fur-gap-8 !fur-gap-3 fur-mt-auto fur-flex-col !fur-items-start">
    
<a href="https://www.furmancenter.org/soc-report/state-of-the-city-2024/"
    class="link-orange"
     target=""     rel="">
  Explore the Data</a>
</div>
</article>
                    </div>
                                    <div class="swiper-slide fur-h-auto">
                        
<article class="fur-bg-white fur-p-6 fur-border fur-border-orange fur-flex fur-flex-col fur-gap-8 fur-rounded-radius-1 fur-h-full">
    
    <h3 class="fur-text-purple fur-title--heading-5">
        Neighborhood Data Profiles    </h3>

            <p class="fur-body--sm">
            Explore and download neighborhood indicators for each of New York City’s 59 community districts, including housing market conditions and development trends.        </p>
    
    
<div class="fur-flex fur-flex-wrap fur-items-center fur-gap-8 !fur-gap-3 fur-mt-auto fur-flex-col !fur-items-start">
    
